   "source": [
    "## Switching models mid-session\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "import subprocess\n",
    "subprocess.run(['ollama', 'run', 'deepseek-coder:6.7b', '--help'])\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Change `OLLAMA_MODEL` in `.env` and restart the server to switch.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Available models on your Drive after first run\n",
    "\n",
    "| Model | Size | Use for |\n",
    "|-------|------|---------|\n",
    "| `dolphin-mistral:latest` | 4.1GB | Characters (Nina, Iris, Vale, Hazel) |\n",
    "| `deepseek-coder:6.7b` | 3.8GB | Code tasks |\n",
    "\n",
    "## Cost\n",
